WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
A daily order export becomes a checked JSON report and a written

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
summary. The agent must create and execute the analysis.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Your worker coordinates through Harakiri. OpenCode and Python run in the

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
sandbox; model inference is external.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:43.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Paid revenue: 2500 + 19900 + 7200 = 29600 cents. Exclude the refunded

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:52.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
order. Keep the input unchanged.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Install the SDK on your worker. Set the Harakiri API URL and key

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:08.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
privately. The sandbox template already contains OpenCode.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:17.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Keep the returned sandbox ID. Wait until running. The 600-second TTL is

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:26.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
a fallback; cleanup still runs in finally.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:33.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Upload data, not a prewritten analysis. /workspace is the remote sandbox

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:40.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
directory. Retain the local input for verification.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:49.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Pin both main and small models to the free model. Broad tool permissions

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:58.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
apply only to this synthetic, disposable demo.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:10.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
The complete prompt specifies input, program, output schema, execution

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:22.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
and an unchanged CSV. No hidden instructions.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:33.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
run: non-interactive task. --format json: execution events. --model:

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:44.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
explicit model. shellQuote keeps the prompt one argument.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:54.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
agentCommand runs in /workspace. detached returns a job ID. timeoutMs

00:02:54.000 --> 00:03:04.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
limits command execution to four minutes.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:14.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
260 seconds is the caller waiting budget, not a longer execution limit.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:24.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Read logs before cleanup. Exit 0 alone is not acceptance.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:32.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
These are completed tools from the real run. The script checks zero

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:40.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
reported model cost; private reasoning is not published.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:49.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Download JSON, summary and original input before termination.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:58.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
contentBase64 is the file envelope, not the agent answer.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:09.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Assert exact totals and unchanged input before saving. The summary must

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:20.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
be nonempty; its prose needs separate review.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:29.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Verified JSON and summary are saved in your worker. This recording

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:38.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
passed; future agent runs must pass the same checks.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:48.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
finally handles success and failure. Verify terminated. If connectivity

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:58.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
prevents cleanup, recover using the sandbox ID and TTL.
